    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla really beat 100 men?</strong><br>What happens next is pure, physics-driven carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorilla Smash</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top brawler where you take on a frenzy of puny humans with nothing but brute strength, devastating blows, and pure gorilla rage. Smash your way through\u00a0<strong>a mob of enemies</strong> in chaotic, arena-style battles where <strong>sheer strength meets overwhelming numbers</strong>. Dodge attacks, land devastating hits, and survive the absurdity. Some enemies come at you unarmed. Others come with weapons. Either way \u2014 they\u2019re all going down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8d <strong>Play as a massive, unstoppable gorilla</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>100 Men Stand in Your Way</strong> \u2013 Fight through mobs of unarmed and armed enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Physics-based mayhem</strong> with ragdoll enemy reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Meme-fueled violence</strong> that\u2019s as hilarious as it is brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Quick &amp; Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Jump in, go wild, replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>No mercy. No weapons. No problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of stealth. It\u2019s not about tactics.<br>It\u2019s about pure primal SMASHING.<br>Can you take down 100 men... or will the horde finally take you down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash first. Ask questions never.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla really beat 100 men?</strong><br>What happens next is pure, physics-driven carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorilla Smash</strong> is a chaotic, over-the-top brawler where you take on a frenzy of puny humans with nothing but brute strength, devastating blows, and pure gorilla rage. Smash your way through\u00a0<strong>a mob of enemies</strong> in chaotic, arena-style battles where <strong>sheer strength meets overwhelming numbers</strong>. Dodge attacks, land devastating hits, and survive the absurdity. Some enemies come at you unarmed. Others come with weapons. Either way \u2014 they\u2019re all going down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8d <strong>Play as a massive, unstoppable gorilla</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>100 Men Stand in Your Way</strong> \u2013 Fight through mobs of unarmed and armed enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Physics-based mayhem</strong> with ragdoll enemy reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Meme-fueled violence</strong> that\u2019s as hilarious as it is brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Quick &amp; Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Jump in, go wild, replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>No mercy. No weapons. No problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of stealth. It\u2019s not about tactics.<br>It\u2019s about pure primal SMASHING.<br>Can you take down 100 men... or will the horde finally take you down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash first. Ask questions never.</p>",
