        "notes": "Gorilla Smash features stylized cartoon violence, including physics-based combat and blood effects. Players control a powerful gorilla fighting off waves of human enemies using brute force. The game includes exaggerated impacts and ragdoll animations, with visual blood effects during combat.\r\n\r\nThere is no graphic gore, dismemberment, sexual content, or depictions of drug/alcohol use."
